  "description": "Add a touch of nostalgic charm to your junk journal with this Victorian Christmas Journal Pages set. This listing includes 2 matching double-page spreads in warm vintage tones featuring Santa Claus, cozy fireplaces, and classic caroling scenes — perfect for December journaling or holiday-themed crafts.\nAs a bonus, this set also includes a beautifully coordinated writing page with festive holly decorations, ideal for notes, reflections, or list-making.\nThese pages are high-resolution (300 DPI), designed in US Letter size (11″ x 8.5″) and resizable to A4. Great for scrapbook layouts, junk journals, art collages, holiday printables, or digital projects.\nFor more coordinating kits and designs, search WhimsyGiftsStudio on Etsy.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Add a touch of nostalgic charm to your junk journal with this Victorian Christmas Journal Pages set. This listing includes 2 matching double-page spreads in warm vintage tones featuring Santa Claus, cozy fireplaces, and classic caroling scenes — perfect for December journaling or holiday-themed crafts.</p>\n<p>As a bonus, this set also includes a beautifully coordinated writing page with festive holly decorations, ideal for notes, reflections, or list-making.</p>\n<p>These pages are high-resolution (300 DPI), designed in US Letter size (11″ x 8.5″) and resizable to A4. Great for scrapbook layouts, junk journals, art collages, holiday printables, or digital projects.</p>\n<p>For more coordinating kits and designs, search WhimsyGiftsStudio on Etsy.</p>",
